WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.980
This show contains scenes that some viewers may find disturbing. Viewer discretion is advised.

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:02.660
No! Let me go!

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:03.750
Stop it!

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.400
Rita! Rita!

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.790
Miss!

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:10.610
Whoa, she pissed herself!

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.030
Bloody hell...

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.860
No!

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.740
Stop!

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.530
Do you men realize
what'll happen if you—

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:23.080
Better worry about yourself!

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:28.670
We'll treat you nice like your
little miss soon enough.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.510
There we go!

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:38.680
Stop it! Stop! Please stop!

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.640
Huh? Why's it so dark?

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:47.860
Who are you supposed to be?!

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:53.800
Hi there. It's me, Arc.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:56.900
That was kind of repulsive,
so I went with a sneak attack.

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:50.500
Where exactly am I?

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:59.900
What the heck is this?!

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:02.000
The heck is this?!

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.870
The heck is this?!

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:08.650
Okay, calm down, me.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:12.250
I recognize this gear.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:15.030
It's got light and fire element resistance!

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:17.230
On top of all kinds of passive supports!

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:19.330
A totally OP set of armor!

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:20.800
The Holy Armor of Belenus!

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:26.850
The Twilight Cloak, which has darkness
resistance and provides mana regeneration!

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:30.320
Providing status immunities
that are based on your level...

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:32.080
The Holy Shield of Teutates!

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:37.760
And the blade that strikes as fast
and bright as the lightning it's bathed in...

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:40.610
The Holy Thunder Sword, Caladbolg!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.360
No doubt about it!

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.260
This is my character
from that game: Arc!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:46.580
<b>Core Stats
Vitality
Mana
Attack
Defense
Magic Attack
Magic Defense</b>

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:46.580
<b>Agility
Focus
Accuracy</b>

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:46.580
<b>Elemental Resistance
Light Resistance
Dark Resistance
Fire Resistance
Water Resistance</b>

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:51.330
I remember falling asleep
playing yesterday, but...

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:53.540
Is this a dream?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:58.230
Still, the sensation of holding this
sword seems too real for that.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:00.800
Not to mention super-sweet!

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:08.460
I'm covered in metal armor
and I barely even notice the weight.

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:09.650
It's not hot, either.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:14.710
Well, may as well try it out, I guess!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.180
Let's see... I think it was like this.

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:19.690
Wyvern Slash!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.240
<b>Wyvern Slash</b>

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:28.450
Seriously, what the heck?!

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:32.800
Was the Wyvern Slash
skill always this powerful?

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:36.040
Maybe I can use magic, too...

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:37.040
Fire!

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.880
<b>F
i
r
e</b>

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.730
Th-That'll come in handy.

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:48.180
Am I inside of the game somehow?

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:52.610
But it all seems way too realistic for that.

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:57.480
Let's see, yesterday I fell
asleep while playing...

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.790
My primary job was Holy Knight,

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:03.440
with a sub-job as a Priest...

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:06.240
Which means I shouldn't
be able to use a Mage's Fire at all.

00:05:07.130 --> 00:05:12.270
Maybe I'm able to use all the skills
from the upgrade path to Holy Knight?

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:11.290
<b>Summoner</b>

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:13.080
<b>Sacred Knight</b>

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:13.580
<b>Bishop</b>

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:15.000
<b>Sorcerer</b>

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:15.160
<b>Knight</b>

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:14.720
If that's the case...

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.160
<b>Mage</b>

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.160
<b>Soldier</b>

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:15.160
<b>Monk</b>

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.540
I'm super strong!

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:24.180
I am so glad I didn't get stuck
with just the Holy Knight skills!

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:27.920
The devs really threw those
together mostly for aesthetics.

00:05:30.240 --> 00:05:35.640
And I wouldn't be a real gamer if I didn't
want to put these skills to the test!

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:40.430
But maybe I should eat first.

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:45.980
No food, and no funds either...

00:05:45.980 --> 00:05:48.190
Guess I better find a town or something.

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:50.490
Gate!

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:50.490
<b>Gate</b>

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:04.370
M-Makes sense...

00:06:04.370 --> 00:06:09.620
Gate is magic for teleporting
to towns you've already been to.

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:11.930
But since I wasn't given any options,

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:16.020
I assume I need to have a destination
in mind for it to work here.

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:21.010
Hang on, there's another skill that
should be handy for getting around.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.530
<b>Dimension Move</b>

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.360
Dimension Move!

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:31.620
There we go.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.660
In the game it let me teleport to
any point on the screen I clicked on...

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:41.250
But in this world, it works as a kind
of short-range, line-of-sight teleportation spell.

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:49.210
There's not much delay to it,
so it should be pretty handy for transportation!

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:50.720
And to be honest,

00:06:51.320 --> 00:06:53.670
I'm having a blast!

00:06:55.280 --> 00:06:58.280
Man, that is some realistic-looking water!

00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:08.200
Crap. I did pick the skeleton avatar...

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:11.930
This is really bad.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:14.990
If I show up in town looking like this,
it wouldn't just be a commotion...

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:18.790
They'll try and exterminate me as a monster!

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:22.250
I refuse to become someone else's XP!

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:24.670
Okay!

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:27.480
Let's draw as little attention as possible!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.090
That's the only way.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:33.630
A-And I had better not take my
helmet off in town, no matter what.

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:51.280
m 0 0 l 182 0 l 182 54 l 0 54

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:51.280
Luvierte Castle Town

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:52.960
Did you hear?

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:55.810
There's another huge basilisk about.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:58.340
I hope I never run into it.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:02.620
Okay, cool, I seem to be fitting in.

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:05.330
How about it, Sir Knight?

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:06.840
I can make you a good deal.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:10.210
Oh, I actually don't
have any money on me.

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:15.840
Well, that's strange,
considering how impressive he looks.

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:21.140
Can't have a fantasy setting
without an inn-slash-pub!

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:26.270
Now that I'm getting a better look,

00:08:26.270 --> 00:08:28.430
this place is definitely
heavy on the medieval,

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:31.070
maybe not so heavy on the fantasy...

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:36.530
What is this rich aroma?!

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:49.750
I-I need to get something
to pay for it with, first...

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:04.580
I guess back alleys still look
the same, even in a fantasy world.

00:09:05.070 --> 00:09:08.020
I'm telling you, even the vaguest
information would be enough!

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:10.630
You don't know when to quit, do you?

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:13.510
I couldn't turn anything up, all right?

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:14.650
Understand?

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:18.450
In spite of the fact that I paid double
your usual rates for the investigation?

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:21.610
And investigate I did!

00:09:21.610 --> 00:09:24.540
But it wasn't a "payment upon
success" kind of job, was it?

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:32.880
Pain in the ass elf...

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:34.840
Ex-squeeze me?!

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:40.350
Sh-she really is an elf!

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.970
Now that's fantastical!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.000
I-I can't just stand here...

00:09:57.090 --> 00:09:59.330
She's gone? That sucks!

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:05.290
m 0 0 l 124 0 l 124 54 l 0 54

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:05.290
Mercenary Guild

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.880
A mercenary guild?

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.090
Here we go!

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:10.820
You could accept quests that'd
pay out in places like this in the game, too!

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:18.800
Impressive...

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:20.030
Who's that?

00:10:20.030 --> 00:10:21.260
Never seen him before.

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.050
Have you got a second?

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:28.280
You need a mercenary's
license in order to accept

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:31.630
the quests on the board, right?

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:33.230
That's right.

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:35.930
Then set me up with one!

00:10:35.930 --> 00:10:37.360
Are you joking, mister?

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:42.320
From the look of it, you're a knight
who's already got fine employment.

00:10:42.690 --> 00:10:43.840
<i>Crap!</i>

00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:48.210
<i>I should probably sound the
way I look if I wanna avoid suspicion!</i>

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:52.630
Circumstances have
led me to require the license.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.550
I'd ask you to not probe further.

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.630
Fair enough, I suppose.

00:10:57.310 --> 00:11:00.300
But there's a trial before
you can get a license.

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:04.570
Beasts, monsters, or bandits.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:09.970
You need to hunt three of any,
and then return with proof.

00:11:10.140 --> 00:11:12.380
Woo, monsters!

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:15.190
Forgive me, it is a personal matter.

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:18.630
Then I need only bring
proof that I've slain three,

00:11:18.630 --> 00:11:21.300
and you will provide my license?

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:22.250
Right.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:25.660
Even the kids around
here know that much.

00:11:26.560 --> 00:11:28.810
Understood. I shall return.

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:35.460
Do you suppose that
knight will be all right?

00:11:35.460 --> 00:11:37.040
Leave him be.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.090
You can tell his situation's complicated.

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:45.800
Forced to take merc work
to pay for his sick child, I'd say.

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:48.400
That's a damned tragedy!

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.840
Good luck, Sir Knight!

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:54.210
L-Looks like I got a
randomly-assigned backstory...

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.740
One more to go.

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:09.710
One more and then delicious-smelling 
grilled meat will be mine!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:15.520
Gotta say, I was really excited about
the prospect of monsters, but...

00:12:15.520 --> 00:12:18.800
I guess the real fantasy
stuff is actually pretty rare.

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:23.040
Another boar?

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.010
An orc?!

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:29.480
A typical starter trash mob!

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:36.090
Now that's fantastical!

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.620
Commemorating the first
monster I've ever slain!

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:46.200
One orc, down for the count!

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:52.040
Episode 1

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:52.040
The Wandering Knight Sets Out to Make the World a Better Place

00:12:56.500 --> 00:12:59.500
That orc was bigger than I figured.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:13.520
<i>M-Man, I just stumbled
into some real trouble!</i>

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:21.820
<i>From the look of things, I'd say that's
a lady in good standing and her maid?</i>

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:30.710
<i>Well, it's pretty obvious
where this is going.</i>

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:35.240
<i>Pretty obvious whose side
I should take, too. But...</i>

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:37.370
<i>These are humans.</i>

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:40.610
<i>Not like fighting a monster.</i>

00:13:40.610 --> 00:13:44.210
<i>It's less like hunting and more like PvP.</i>

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:47.370
No! Let me go!

00:13:47.370 --> 00:13:48.420
Stop it!

00:13:48.420 --> 00:13:50.260
Rita! Rita!

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:52.960
<i>They've got a huge numbers advantage.</i>

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:52.720
Miss!

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:58.720
<i>In PvP, if you're outnumbered,
you usually don't stand a chance.</i>

00:13:58.720 --> 00:14:01.320
Miss! Miss Lauren!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:03.820
Whoa, she pissed herself!

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.280
Bloody hell...

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:08.650
No!

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:10.400
Stop!

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:13.450
Man, it just keeps getting worse!

00:14:13.450 --> 00:14:17.520
Do you men realize
what'll happen if you—

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.760
Better worry about yourself!

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:26.380
We'll treat you nice, like your
little miss, soon enough.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.220
<i>It'll be okay! I can manage this!</i>

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:32.340
<i>I'm covered head to toe
in Mythic-class gear!</i>

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:38.340
There we go!

00:14:36.990 --> 00:14:38.820
No!

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:42.360
Stop! Stop it! Please stop!

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:47.320
Huh? Why's it so dark?

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:05.960
Wh-What the hell just happened?

00:15:11.430 --> 00:15:13.160
Shit, this is bad!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:15.720
Wh-What was that?!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:16.880
Boss!

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:24.070
W-Wait for me!

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.740
<b>Wyvern Slash</b>

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:36.200
Wyvern Slash!

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:56.720
Is everything all right?

00:15:58.800 --> 00:16:01.900
Thank you for saving us.

00:16:02.580 --> 00:16:07.770
This is Lauren Laraiya du Luvierte,
of the Luvierte family.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.870
I am her attendant, Rita.

00:16:09.870 --> 00:16:12.700
Hey, it was no big...

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:20.920
I must ask, given your appearance,
are you a knight in the service of some lord?

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:27.530
<i>Well, my character premise in the game
was that, despite becoming a Holy Knight,</i>

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:29.240
<i>I was hit with a nefarious curse,</i>

00:16:29.240 --> 00:16:34.700
<i>and that I'm on a knight's journey across
the land to find a way to cure myself...</i>

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.140
Well...

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:37.910
Ahem.

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:40.030
We can speak later.

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:43.140
For now, you should
clothe yourselves.

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:46.110
I shall clean up the
mess the bandits left.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:48.310
O-Of course!

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:50.000
Thank you, sir.

00:16:50.800 --> 00:16:53.870
Come, miss, let's be on our way.

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:03.520
All righty, these guys might be bandits,
but I'd feel bad just leaving their bodies out.

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:07.520
You can at least serve as
nourishment for the wildflowers.

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:08.460
Fire!

00:17:12.180 --> 00:17:18.460
I've never killed anyone before.
Kinda surprised at the lack of guilt.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:20.840
Is it because they were bad guys?

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:25.850
Those horses must belong to the bandits.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:28.060
Glance.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:40.660
Good! They're not
paying attention to me!

00:17:41.090 --> 00:17:44.080
Time to loot all of the bandits' stuff!

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:48.770
There we go.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:51.160
That oughta cover
my expenses for a while.

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:53.430
E-Excuse me...

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:56.010
Y-Yes?

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:59.660
I see you two have
sorted yourselves out.

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:05.600
Thank you so much for aiding
us in our time of need.

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:09.280
It was a dreadful thing that happened.

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:13.320
I'm not sure how much comfort it is,
but I'm relieved you ladies weren't hurt.

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:19.340
<i>And now I can head back into
town and get me some tasty meat!</i>

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:23.480
We'll be returning to the Luvierte house.

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:26.250
If it's all right with you...

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:46.360
Sir Snight, I can never thank
you enough for what you've done.

00:18:47.140 --> 00:18:49.230
It's quite all right. No thanks are necessary.

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:52.630
I was simply in the vicinity.

00:18:57.080 --> 00:19:00.400
<i>What?! Sh-She's staring holes in me!</i>

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:06.640
Sir Knight, you still haven't
told us your name.

00:19:10.370 --> 00:19:13.140
I am simply a traveler
on a winding journey...

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:15.660
My name is Arc.

00:19:17.520 --> 00:19:19.720
<i>And that was how the Knight Arc</i>

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:23.740
<i>took his first step towards a low-profile life.</i>

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:29.390
<i>Man, I'm still hungry.</i>

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:35.320
m 0 0 l 124 0 l 124 54 l 0 54

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:35.320
Luvierte

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:43.370
That's three. 
Can you draw up that license now?

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:46.890
Uh, I can, but...

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:50.330
I didn't expect you'd be back with
your proof before the day was out.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.400
Congratulations, Sir Knight!

00:19:52.400 --> 00:19:54.040
Care to join us for a round?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:59.510
Uh, I appreciate the offer,
but perhaps another time.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:04.180
Mister, you forgot to take
the rune stone off the orc.

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:07.410
Rune stone?

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:11.740
You always wanna remove the rune
stone from any monsters you kill.

00:20:11.740 --> 00:20:15.130
They can be made into
magic items and weapons.

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:18.810
And here's your mercenary license.

00:20:20.190 --> 00:20:21.260
Very good.

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:25.520
If you're looking for work,
just check the board.

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:29.880
Nothing too remarkable
gets posted there, though.

00:20:29.880 --> 00:20:34.680
If you want to take bigger jobs,
you'll need to join a mercenary guild.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:38.600
Okay! Everything is set, now!

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.000
And with that being the case...

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:45.880
Madam! I intend to celebrate.

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:49.290
Have the food brought to my room 
as quickly as possible!

00:20:49.290 --> 00:20:50.970
Of course!

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.640
Delicious!

00:21:05.640 --> 00:21:07.550
So good...

00:21:07.550 --> 00:21:10.800
Flavors and fragrances
I've never had before.

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:13.570
And it tastes even better after the wait!

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:22.360
It's a little warm, but this ale is great, too!

00:21:22.360 --> 00:21:24.290
Nice and fruity!

00:21:28.460 --> 00:21:31.530
Rune stone from an orc, huh?

00:21:33.230 --> 00:21:34.460
It's pretty!

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:39.520
I managed to handle some quests,
and I was able to get some food, too!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:44.940
This is no game!
It's reality! Another world!

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:47.240
There's plenty of other
skills I want to try,

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:50.080
and more fantasy stuff
for me to encounter!

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.950
I can't wait to start questing tomorrow!

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
Next Time

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:45.020
A First Job, a Girl's Wish, and an Approaching Shadow

00:23:45.020 --> 00:23:50.030
